That's the problem. The .gitignore file exists but has no contents, so git ignores nothing. Let me give you the contents to paste in:
Open E:\Workspace\Qt\ChessBotUI\.gitignore in any text editor (Notepad works) and paste this:
# --- Python ---
engine/venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.pyd
.Python
*.egg-info/

# --- C++ / CMake build artifacts ---
build/
*.exe
*.obj
*.o
*.a
*.lib
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib
CMakeCache.txt
CMakeFiles/
cmake_install.cmake
Makefile

# --- IDE / editor ---
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.DS_Store

# --- Qt ---
*.user
*.user.*
moc_*.cpp
moc_*.h
ui_*.h
qrc_*.cpp

# --- Misc ---
*.log
.env